 "text": "Assessor's Office | Buchanan County, MO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nAbout Buchanan County\nAbout Buchanan County\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty News\nElections\nFAQs\nJobs\nHelpful Websites\nCounty Offices\nCounty Offices\n5th Judicial Circuit Courts\nAssessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nCollector's Office\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commissioners Office\nCounty Counselor\nCounty Fairgrounds\nEmergency Management\nGIS\nHuman Resources\nPlanning & Zoning\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nPurchasing\nRecorder of Deeds Office\nMedical Examiner\nRoad and Bridge - East\nRoad and Bridge - West\nSheriff's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nResident Information\nResident Information\nAssessor's Office\nCollector's Office\nEmergency Management\nEmployment Opportunities\nMarriage Licenses\nMilitary Discharge Records\nMissouri Property Tax Credit Program\nProsecuting Attorney's Office\nPublic Record Search\nSheriff's Office\nVoting Information\nEconomic Development\nEconomic Development\nAuditor's Office\nMerchant & Manufacturer License\nPlanning & Zoning\nPurchasing\nReal Estate\nRecorder's Office\nBuchanan County Comprehensive Plan\nService Center\nService Center\nAssessor's Office\nChild Support Enforcement Services\nCollector's Office\nEmployment Opportunities\nGIS\nMarriage Licenses\nMerchant & Manufacturer License\nMissouri Property Tax Credit Program\nMissouri Unclaimed Property\nNew Residents\nOnline Payments\nOpioid Settlement Funds\nPermits and Licenses\nPublic Record Search\nPurchasing\nReal Estate\nResidential Watch\nVictim's Services\nVoting Information\nMy Profile\nBuchanan County Missouri\n/ Assessor's Office\nAssessor's Office\nPopular Pages\nAssessor's Office Popular Pages\nPersonal Property\nReal Estate\nBusiness Personal Property\nContact\nDepartment Name\nAssessor's Office\nAddress\n411 Jules Street, Rooms 122 & 222, Saint Joseph, MO 64501\nPhone\n816-271-1520\nHours of Operation\nMonday - Friday\n08:00 AM - 04:30 PM\nHelpful Links\nProperty Inquiry Search\nGIS Mapping\nPersonal Property FAQ\nReal Estate FAQ\nLeasing\nAircraft\nMilitary Personal Property\nMobile or Manufactured Homes Information\nImportant Dates\nE-File Assessment List\nBanner Image\nBanner Image\nParent Page\nBuchanan County Missouri\nAssessor's Office\nDepartment\nAssessor's Office\nHeader Menu\nNo content items.\nBuchanan County has over 40,000 parcels of land on the real tax roll and over 110,000 articles of personal property that have to be valued each year.\nThe Assessor is an elected official responsible for developing and maintaining a current list of all taxable real and tangible personal property in Buchanan County. However, the Assessor's work is subject to review by the County Board of Equalization and the State Tax Commission. The State Tax Commission is the state agency charged with general supervision of Assessors in Missouri and with enforcing property tax laws. ( State Tax Commission FAQ )\nWe have the difficult task of preparing an annual assessment roll that accurately reflects the value of all taxable property within the jurisdiction.\nThe Assessor totals the assessment roll typically by July 1st of each year. Those numbers are turned over to the Buchanan County Clerk who then distributes the assessment information to the various taxing districts within the county. Taxing jurisdictions such as city, state, school, park, library, fire, and road districts adopt budgets after public meetings over the assessment values for their district. Taxing districts typically set their budgets and levies by the end of September each year. The Buchanan County Assessor is not part of the taxing district's budget or the levy process, the Assessor's job was completed with the reassessment process. The levies set determine your taxes for the year. The taxes you pay are proportionate to the value of your property compared to the total value of the taxing district in which your property is located.\nIf you have a question about paying your tax bill\nContact the County Collector with questions regarding:\nNot receiving one or more statements\nGeneral questions concerning the collection process\nProperty Inquiry Search\nType : HotTopics\nGIS Mapping\nType : HotTopics\nPersonal Property FAQ\nType : HotTopics\nReal Estate FAQ\nType : HotTopics\nLeasing\nType : HotTopics\nAircraft\nType : HotTopics\nMilitary Personal Property\nType : HotTopics\nMobile or Manufactured Homes Information\nType : HotTopics\nImportant Dates\nType : HotTopics\nE-File Assessment List\nType : HotTopics\nPopularPagesWidget (43f2d9dh3199w7b3w0s2d9rc5b)\nType : PopularPagesWidget\nNavigation\nBuchanan County Missouri\nTrue\nContact Us\nBuchanan County 411 Jules Street, Saint Joseph, MO 64501\nHelpful Links\nAbout Buchanan County\nCommissioners Agenda\nNew to the Area\nMaps\nFAQs\nConnect With Us\nPowered by MCCi Government Websites",
